					"Diablo II runeword calculator with cubing support, .d2s/.d2i import and many filters and sorting options.",
				tech: "SvelteKit, TypeScript",
			},
			{
				title: "D2R Map Seed Tool",
				links: [
					{
						label: "GitHub",
						href: "https://github.com/feored/d2mapseed",
